{
  "declaredLength": 3484,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位就是皙白大人的勁敵，\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>大人啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D5C31662F7699767D59274EBA768452C16575FF0C000A001000020100000059274EBA554AFF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "久仰大名了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E454EF05927540D4E86300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我名叫裘投，\n熱愛的寶可夢是投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211540D53EB88D86295FF0C000A71B1611B76845BF653EF5922662F629564549B3C300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊！竟被搶先一步了。\n果然投摔鬼的愛好者就是滑頭！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554AFF017ADF88AB643651484E006B654E863002000A679C7136629564549B3C7684611B597D80055C31662F6ED1982DFF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是斐打，\n打擊鬼是我鍾愛不渝的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F65906253FF0C000A625364CA9B3C662F6211937E611B4E0D6E1D76845BF653EF5922300200100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n容我為<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說明一下狀況。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A5BB9621170BA00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA660E4E004E0B72C06CC1300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這兩位分別是\n打擊鬼與投摔鬼的愛好者。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901951694F4D52065225662F000A625364CA9B3C8207629564549B3C7684611B597D8005300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他們正打算用對戰一較高下，\n看哪邊的寶可夢更強大。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED650116B6362537B9775285C0D62304E008F039AD84E0BFF0C000A770B54EA908A76845BF653EF592266F45F375927300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其實我正在找第5個隊友，\n希望<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>您能幫個忙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765BE662116B635728627E7B2C0035500B968A53CBFF0C000A5E0C671B001000020100000060A880FD5E6B500B5FD9FF0100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊！竟又被搶先一步了，\n果然投摔鬼的愛好者就是一點都不吃虧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554AFF017ADF53C888AB643651484E006B654E86FF0C000A679C7136629564549B3C7684611B597D80055C31662F4E009EDE90FD4E0D54038667FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的隊伍也正在找\n第5個成員啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684968A4F0D4E5F6B635728627E000A7B2C0035500B621054E1554AFF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "兩位請別激動。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51694F4D8ACB52256FC052D5300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意協助某一方嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000300200100001BE01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F535452A967D04E0065B955CEFF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>大人！\n請務必來為我的打擊鬼軍團助陣！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000059274EBAFF01000A8ACB52D95FC54F8670BA62117684625364CA9B3C8ECD571852A99663FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！\n請務必加入我的投摔鬼陣營。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF01000A8ACB52D95FC552A0516562117684629564549B3C966371DF300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳只帶上1隻打擊鬼或投摔鬼，\n然後來告訴我一聲。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EA5E364E0A003196BB625364CA9B3C6216629564549B3CFF0C000A71365F8C4F86544A8A3462114E008072300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶著打擊鬼呢。\n那麼，是要加入打擊鬼軍團嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E368457625364CA9B3C54623002000A90A39EBCFF0C662F898152A05165625364CA9B3C8ECD571855CEFF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶著投摔鬼呢。\n那麼，是要加入投摔鬼陣營嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E368457629564549B3C54623002000A90A39EBCFF0C662F898152A05165629564549B3C966371DF55CEFF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要加入！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898152A05165FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好的！請仔細思考\n再決定要加入哪一方。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D7684FF018ACB4ED47D30601D8003000A518D6C7A5B9A898152A0516554EA4E0065B9300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "斐打，\n打擊鬼軍團有幫手了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65906253FF0C000A625364CA9B3C8ECD571867095E6B624B4E86300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我軍勝券在握啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118ECD52DD5238572863E15566FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "裘投，\n投摔鬼陣營有幫手了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88D86295FF0C000A629564549B3C966371DF67095E6B624B4E86300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您願意選擇投摔鬼陣營，\n這真是我們極大的榮幸！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A89858610F907864C7629564549B3C966371DFFF0C000A9019771F662F6211501169755927768469AE5E78FF0100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，現在就來開始這場\n打擊鬼軍團和投摔鬼陣營的對決吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C73FE57285C314F86958B59CB90195834000A625364CA9B3C8ECD5718548C629564549B3C966371DF76845C0D6C7A5427FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不才小弟我，\n會擔任這場勝負的見證人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D624D5C0F5F1F6211FF0C000A670364D44EFB9019583452DD8CA07684898B8B494EBA300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "首先是規則確認。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n雙方請依序派出先鋒、次鋒、\n中堅、副將以及主將上場，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以最後獲勝次數較多的一方為勝利。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "99965148662F898F524778BA8A8D300200100001BE01000A96D965B98ACB4F9D5E8F6D3E51FA514892D230016B2192D23001000A4E2D58053001526F5C074EE553CA4E3B5C074E0A5834FF0C00100001BE00000A4EE567005F8C737252DD6B2165788F03591A76844E0065B970BA52DD5229300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，開始！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C958B59CBFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先鋒戰，\n疾風打擊鬼與神速投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514892D26230FF0C000A75BE98A8625364CA9B3C8207795E901F629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一勝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0052DDFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獲勝的是疾風打擊鬼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "737252DD7684662F75BE98A8625364CA9B3CFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "次鋒戰，\n怒濤打擊鬼與氣勢投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B2192D26230FF0C000A60126FE4625364CA9B3C82076C2352E2629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "兩半勝合一勝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5169534A52DD54084E0052DDFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獲勝的是氣勢投摔鬼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "737252DD7684662F6C2352E2629564549B3CFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中堅戰，\n不動打擊鬼與腿技投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D58056230FF0C000A4E0D52D5625364CA9B3C8207817F6280629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "半勝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "534A52DDFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獲勝的是腿技投摔鬼！\n目前是投摔鬼陣營兩勝一敗。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "737252DD7684662F817F6280629564549B3CFF01000A76EE524D662F629564549B3C966371DF516952DD4E006557300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "副將戰，\n必殺打擊鬼與移動投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "526F5C076230FF0C000A5FC56BBA625364CA9B3C820779FB52D5629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一勝！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0052DDFF01FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獲勝的是必殺打擊鬼！\n現在是兩勝兩敗，雙方平手了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "737252DD7684662F5FC56BBA625364CA9B3CFF01000A73FE5728662F516952DD51696557FF0C96D965B95E73624B4E86300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下來將要迎接主將戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B4F865C0789818FCE63A54E3B5C076230300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "主將戰，\n空降打擊鬼與赤面投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
