      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "主將戰，\n青面打擊鬼與空降投摔鬼。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3B5C076230FF0C000A97529762625364CA9B3C82077A7A964D629564549B3C300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "決戰開始！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C7A6230958B59CBFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一勝！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0052DDFF01FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獲勝的是打擊鬼軍團的主將\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "737252DD7684662F625364CA9B3C8ECD571876844E3B5C07000A0010000201000000FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太棒啦！\n證明出打擊鬼有多優秀啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A68D25566FF01000A8B49660E51FA625364CA9B3C6709591A512A79C05566FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "贏得漂亮。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D0F5F976F024EAE300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝啊！不過，\n這次的勝利是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>大人拿下的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n還希望今後有機會領教投摔鬼的厲害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D554AFF014E0D904EFF0C000A90196B21768452DD5229662F001000020100000059274EBA62FF4E0B7684300200100001BE00000A90845E0C671B4ECA5F8C67096A5F670398186559629564549B3C768453B25BB3300200100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "獲勝的是投摔鬼陣營的主將\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "737252DD7684662F629564549B3C966371DF76844E3B5C07000A0010000201000000FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太棒了！\n投摔鬼的卓越實力拿下勝利了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A68D24E86FF01000A629564549B3C768453538D8A5BE6529B62FF4E0B52DD52294E86300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然不得了。\n實在是贏不過投摔鬼的投技啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C71364E0D5F974E863002000A5BE65728662F8D0F4E0D904E629564549B3C768462956280554A300200100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝您！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但若不是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我們是無法獲勝的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n今後還請多讓我領教打擊鬼的厲害。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D60A8FF0100100001BE01000A4F4682E54E0D662F0010000201000000FF0C000A62115011662F71216CD5737252DD7684300200100001BE00000A4ECA5F8C90848ACB591A8B93621198186559625364CA9B3C768453B25BB3300200100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "放下勝敗，互相稱讚彼此的表現，\n真是出色的運動家精神。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這正是武道家的精神啊！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，贏得漂亮！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653E4E0B52DD6557FF0C4E9276F87A318B9A5F7C6B647684886873FEFF0C000A771F662F51FA82727684904B52D55BB67CBE795E300200100001BE01000A90196B63662F6B6690535BB676847CBE795E554AFF01000A0010000201000000FF0C8D0F5F976F024EAEFF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何讓<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>大人願意正式加入，\n這就是打擊鬼軍團今後的課題了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F558B93001000020100000059274EBA9858610F6B635F0F52A05165FF0C000A90195C31662F625364CA9B3C8ECD57184ECA5F8C76848AB2984C4E86FF0100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "投摔鬼陣營會為<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>您\n準備永世主將的席位！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "629564549B3C966371DF670370BA001000020100000060A8000A6E9650996C384E164E3B5C0776845E2D4F4DFF0100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
